            "review_text": "hoanglechi\nMilpitas, California46 contributions\n0\nGood price, good original Hue food\nJan 2017 • Friends\nWe came here three times during stay in Saigon. The food was very tasty here but the importance: they cook with original taste of Hue. The dish Mi` Quang? was the best we ever had ever. I also loved Bun' Bo Hue and Banh' Beo`. Forgot to try Tre' here, though. The price is kind of high to normal residents in Saigon, but very reasonable to us from abroad. The place was clean, service was good.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 14, 2017",
